MailSalonGUI is a separate Go/Fyne application.
Local backend packages in internal/config, maildir, mimeutil, transport, pim,
and pgp were adapted from MailSalon by Britney Lozza:
https://github.com/SeraphinaDX/MailSalon
Reference commit: 206def078a21547916f7f6242907cde81de9c7d5 (MailSalon 0.6.1).
MailSalonGUI does not import or execute the MailSalon terminal application.
The original license is preserved in LICENSE (GNU GPL version 3).
Modifications: independent config path, cross-platform command selection,
Reply-To support, draft persistence and the new graphical interface.

